# Local raw source storage
#
# Raw sources may include copyrighted files, sensitive notes, large PDFs, Word
# documents, or private research material. Keep the directory structure in git,
# but do not commit raw source contents by default.
sources/**
!sources/
!sources/**/
!sources/**/.gitkeep
!sources/README.md

# Sensitive private scratch space
private_notes/**
!private_notes/
!private_notes/.gitkeep
!private_notes/README.md

# Local OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
